# DHI-11 V5 — Mass and safety evidence worksheet

**DESIGN-ONLY / HOLD.** This blank record is not compounding authorization. No measurement, supplier contact or bottle event has been fabricated. The existing pour card remains the dose authority for this design; record actual results only after the applicable handling/safety hold is resolved.

