## Product and carrier accounting, after measurements exist

For stock net mass m_i in grams and declared supplied-product mass fraction f_i:

- Supplied-product mass p_i = f_i × m_i. This is not automatically pure odorant or constituent mass.
- Carrier mass c_i = (1 − f_i) × m_i for the confirmed single-carrier preparations.
- Supplied-product ppm w/w in raw-stock concentrate = 1,000,000 × p_i / M_concentrate. M_concentrate includes the working-stock carriers; do not use the sum of odorant masses as that denominator.
- Supplied-product ppm w/w in the finished batch = 1,000,000 × p_i / M_finished, using an independently evidenced final net mass and any documented loss correction.
- Constituent ppm additionally requires the applicable product assay/composition fraction. No irone or coumarin fraction is inferred from the product name or a conflicting SDS.

| Stock | Confirmed preparation fraction | Supplied product mass | Added carrier mass |
|---|---:|---|---|
| Orris Liquid | 0.09 w/w in DEP | 0.09 × m_orris | 0.91 × m_orris DEP |
| Alpha Irone | 0.10 w/w in DEP | 0.10 × m_alpha_irone | 0.90 × m_alpha_irone DEP |
| Ambrettolide | 0.10 w/w in DPG | 0.10 × m_ambrettolide | 0.90 × m_ambrettolide DPG |
| Tonkarome | 0.20 w/w in TEC | 0.20 × m_tonkarome | 0.80 × m_tonkarome TEC |

For neat/as-supplied rows, m_i is supplied-product mass; an EO or base is still a mixture. These equations do not establish product purity. Carrier mass is not carrier volume. A neat-material density cannot supply the density of a prepared DEP/DPG/TEC solution.

## Thirteen unresolved local Category 4 records

Missing local limits do not mean thirteen prohibited ingredients, nor thirteen unrestricted ingredients. Even records present elsewhere in the local table still require appropriate identity, current applicability and finished-product mass review.

| Material | Current evidence disposition | Required resolution |
|---|---|---|
| Alpha Irone | No explicit current-formula record | Product/grade identity and applicable current standard or supplier conformity evidence |
| Alpha Isomethyl Ionone (Methyl Ionone Pure) | Conflicting local alternate-name limits, 7.26 versus 20.0 | Resolve exact product and standard; do not choose either number by alias |
| Ambrettolide | No explicit record | Exact supplied product and applicable current standard/conformity evidence |
| Cedarwood oil Virginia | Natural-mixture evidence incomplete | Species/part/grade/lot identity plus restricted-constituent data and relevant limits |
| Coriander Essential Oil | Seed-EO identity bound; constituent/safety evidence incomplete | Exact seed-oil lot, constituent contributions and applicable limits; not leaf oil |
| Ebanol | No explicit record | Exact trade grade and applicable current standard/conformity evidence |
| Isobutavan | No explicit record | Exact product identity and applicable current standard/conformity evidence |
