| Tonkarome | Public supplier documents conflict | Reconciled product/lot SDS, allergen declaration and application-specific IFRA documentation |
| Verdox | No explicit record | Exact grade and applicable current standard/conformity evidence |
| Vetival | No explicit record | Exact grade and applicable current standard/conformity evidence |

