## Supported recording path and remaining integration gap

The backend has a confirmed-action, immutable-measurement workflow in `LabService.record_bottle_action_measurement()`, followed by an explicitly authorized commit. Use it only for real observed measurements under the confirmed proposal. Do not write through the deprecated duplicate `BottleBatch.add_event()` store.

The V5 design JSON reserves delivered-mass fields, but the release CLI does not ingest those fields as an independently verified measurement chain. Filling this worksheet or that JSON does not automatically clear a gate. A future reviewed bridge must bind stock IDs, measurement evidence, uncertainty, product fractions, losses and the independently measured full-batch denominator. No such bridge or physical database write was made in this audit.
